Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,ﾊﾞｰｽﾄ！ ﾊﾟﾜｰﾌﾟﾗｽ4000！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Жүр! Ex Gallop!
